{"version":1,"content":"<p>房委會今日（15日）表示，高度關注臺日電梯（香港）有限公司涉嫌在觀塘翠屏北邨及沙田博康邨更換升降機工程存在嚴重缺失事件，指目前只有兩個屋邨由有關公司承辦更換升降機工程；</p><p>另一正籌備更換升降機的租置屋邨富亨邨，則尚未批出合約。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T16:19:46.821045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T15:40:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T19:58:18.603435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T16:17:40.278928+00:00","content_hash":"110463f05d9e9855b64333528cb8f2b650d822e066fd793b282e248da1ec6dc1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}